  "body": "## Why\n\nThe independently reviewed 2026-09-16 local implementation never reached GitHub. This is PR-A from the lean MVP plan: land the fixture workbench on `neverhuman/bf` `main` so later slices (no-args TUI, isolation, live Codex, real PRs) can rebase.\n\n## What\n\n- One hub command/job/recovery loop with SQLite, hashed loopback sessions, and generated v3 wire types\n- Embedded Vite/React workbench (goal \u2192 review plan \u2192 start work \u2192 pause/stop)\n- Deterministic `bf demo --fixture basic` and `interrupted_publish` (always `fake: true`)\n- `scripts/check`: fmt, clippy -D, tests, typecheck, Playwright journeys, both demos\n- Honest `BUILD_CHECKPOINT.json`: first-release gate remains false\n\n## Not in this PR\n\nLive Codex/Cursor/Grok, disposable isolation, real GitHub publication, or a TUI. Those are later stacked PRs.\n\n## Verification\n\nLocal `bash scripts/check` exit 0 on this head (`9f03362`): 8 lib + 12 acceptance + 28 hardening tests, 1 UI test, 4 Chromium journeys, both fixture demos.\n\n## HOLD\n\nNo provider keys, enrollments, live grants, or operator decisions.",
